ent-ADTBorgModuleStorage = storage cyborg module
    .desc = A basic module providing internal item storage, like a backpack.
ent-ADTBorgModuleStorageDuffel = duffel storage cyborg module
    .desc = An improved storage module with extra room for tools and supplies.
ent-ADTBorgModuleStorageBluespace = bluespace storage cyborg module
    .desc = A module using bluespace technology for near-limitless internal storage.
ent-BorgModuleGravity = gravity manipulation cyborg module
    .desc = A cyborg module to break the laws of gravity.
ent-BorgModuleYEET = Y.E.E.T. cyborg module
    .desc = How to reload is apparently an exercise left to the cyborg.
ent-BorgModuleAggressiveLube = aggressive cleaning cyborg module
    .desc = A janitorial module to deploy cleaning ordnance to the station. This one's been tampered with.
ent-BorgModuleXenobio = xenobio cyborg module
    .desc = A science module to manage xenobiological research.
ent-BorgModuleAdvancedXenobio = advanced xenobio cyborg module
    .desc = A science module to manage advanced xenobiological research.
ent-BorgModuleSpraying = nozzle cyborg module
    .desc = A janitorial module to rapidly spray chemicals of dubious value all over the station.
ent-BorgModuleComedicViolence = comedic violence cyborg module
    .desc = A service module for committing VIOLENCE..... with foam.
ent-BorgModuleLibrarian = librarian cyborg module
    .desc = A service module for when a tider throws 3072 books around the station.
ent-BorgModuleAdvancedBotany = advanced botany cyborg module
    .desc = A service module for advanced plant work.
ent-BorgModuleCooking = chef cyborg module
    .desc = A service module to allow a borg to cook delicious meals for the crew.
ent-BorgModuleBFG = B.F.G. cyborg module
    .desc = A salvage module that gives cyborgs a REALLY BIG GUN. Install with caution.
ent-BorgModuleFulton = fulton cyborg module
    .desc = A salvage module for rapid extraction of valuables back to the hoard.
ent-BorgModuleNuclear = nuclear engineering cyborg module
    .desc = An engineering module for establishing nuclear power and probably not melting down.
ent-BorgModuleFlatpack = flatpack cyborg module
    .desc = An engineering module for rapidly constructing prefabricated structures.
ent-BorgModuleSyringeGun = syringe gun cyborg module
    .desc = A medical module for injecting chemicals into unruly patients.
ent-BorgModuleAdvancedRescue = advanced rescue cyborg module
    .desc = A medical module for recovering even the most distant lost soul.
ent-BorgModuleJetpack = jetpack cyborg module
    .desc = A universal module with an experimental jetpack that does not require fuel to operate.
ent-BorgModuleMedgun = medbeam cyborg module
    .desc = A medical module with a medbeam gun. Heals crew members by draining the cyborg's power cell.
ent-BorgModuleDetective = detective cyborg module
    .desc = A security module for investigations. Comes with a forensic scanner, a forensic pad, a pen and paper.
