ent-WeaponMechIndustrialKineticAccelerator = industrial kinetic accelerator
    .desc = An industrial-grade proto-kinetic accelerator. Hits way harder and recharges on its own.
ent-ADTBorgLauncherLubenade = experimental lube cannon
    .desc = This has been modified to recharge and fire lubenades instead, but odds are the borgs won't notice.
ent-ADTBulletGrenadeLubenade = lubenade grenade round
